  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/4f9cadf5-56f5-4be4-82ee-e7fda6afacf3-image.png\"/></p><p>Tangent at P</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>sec</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> Passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sec</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p>Now slope of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AP</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo> </mo><mi>sec</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo> </mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>θ</mi></math></p><p>Now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∈</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>∵</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>∈</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo><mn>1</mn><mo><</mo><mi>e</mi><mo><</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>b</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi></msqrt><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∵</mo><mo>∆</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is isosceles-right angled triangle,</p><p>So, area<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math>.</p>",
